@startuml
participant Caller
participant ProviderComposition as Composition
participant LifecycleController as Lifecycle
participant CommunicationProvider as Provider
Caller -> Composition: submit(public provider-route handle, item)
Composition -> Lifecycle: authenticate exact route and endpoint generations
Lifecycle --> Composition: active snapshots and retained declarations
Composition -> Composition: validate handle and every item binding
alt exact and active
Composition -> Provider: submit(internal token, validated item)
Provider --> Composition: internal bounded outcome
Composition --> Caller: public bounded outcome
else stale, inactive, or mismatched
Composition --> Caller: deterministic rejection, no provider call
end
@enduml
